### POST quote
POST {{host}}/api/shipping/quote
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "address": {
    "postalCode": "1500",
    "latitude": 0,
    "longitude": 0
  },
  "items": [
    {
      "id": "{{lineId}}",
      "productId": "{{productId}}",
      "variantId": "{{variantId}}",
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}

### Invalid body (400)
POST {{host}}/api/shipping/quote
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### GET addresses/search
GET {{host}}/api/shipping/addresses/search?query=Example&limit=5
Accept: application/json

### Empty query (400)
GET {{host}}/api/shipping/addresses/search?query=&limit=5
Accept: application/json

### GET addresses/hydrate
GET {{host}}/api/shipping/addresses/hydrate?reference=area:0:0
Accept: application/json

### Empty reference (400)
GET {{host}}/api/shipping/addresses/hydrate?reference=
Accept: application/json

### Invalid coordinate pair (400)
POST {{host}}/api/shipping/quote
Content-Type: application/json

{"address":{"latitude":0},"items":[{"productId":"{{productId}}"}]}

### Out of range address (400)
POST {{host}}/api/shipping/quote
Content-Type: application/json

{"address":{"latitude":91,"longitude":0},"items":[{"productId":"{{productId}}"}]}

### Unavailable product (200 with isAvailable=false and product_not_found)
POST {{host}}/api/shipping/quote
Content-Type: application/json

{"address":{"latitude":0,"longitude":0},"items":[{"productId":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001"}]}
